                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>145,825 Kwh</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Wind is the largest energy source, contributing</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> 214,492 KWh</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, while Geothermal has the lowest contribution at </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>164,182 KWh</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
